On May 23, 2022, Nucor completed the issuance and sale of $500 million aggregate principal amount of its 3.950% Notes due 2025 (the “2025 Notes”) and $500 million aggregate principal amount of its 4.300% Notes due 2027 (the “2027 Notes”).
We expect to continue to have adequate access to the capital markets at a reasonable cost of funds for liquidity purposes when needed.
